{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"tomorrow-night-classic","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Tomorrow Night","description":"A dark, balanced theme with calm pastel syntax colors.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Tomorrow Night","path":"themes/tomorrow-night-classic.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/tomorrow-night-classic.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Tomorrow Night\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1d1f21\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#c5c8c6\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#191b1d\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#151718\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#151718\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#191b1d\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#282a2e\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#373b41\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#282a2e\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#191b1d\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#151718\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#81a2be\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#81a2be\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#81a2be\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#373b41\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#282a2e80\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#81a2be\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#151718\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#cc6666\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#b5bd68\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#f0c674\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#cc6666\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#969896\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b5bd68\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#de935f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b294bb\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f0c674\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#81a2be\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#de935f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8abeb7\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cc6666\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f0c674\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8abeb7\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Tomorrow Night\n\nA dark, balanced theme with calm pastel syntax colors.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Tomorrow Night** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Tomorrow Night palette by Chris Kempson (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1d1f21` |\n| Text | `#c5c8c6` |\n| Accent | `#81a2be` |\n| Keywords | `#b294bb` |\n| Strings | `#b5bd68` |\n| Functions | `#81a2be` |\n| Types | `#f0c674` |\n| Comments | `#969896` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}